## @file
#  Watari Boot (E11): Graphics Output Protocol on the "simple-framebuffer" node of the guest device
#  tree (/chosen/framebuffer@...), which Watari EL2 writes for the guest's part of the panel.
#  Design: docs/design/watari-edk2-m1/DESIGN.md section 8.4.
